  (text "Power & I/O  —  USB‖external 5V OR-ing, separate laser supply, AD7606 outputs, laser + monitor-PD outputs" (at 36 16 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001226))
  (text "J6 = ext +5V in;  USB VBUS (from J1) ‖ J6 OR-ed via SS14 Schottkys (D5/D6) → +5V.  J5 = laser anode supply (LASER_V+)." (at 36 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001227))
  (text "J3 → external AD7606 (VOUT1..4 = the 4 TIA outputs + CONVST + GND).  J4 → LASER_N/MPD_RAW pairs + LASER_V+ + GND shield/return." (at 36 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001228))
  (text "MPD_RAWx → 10k burden || 100nF → 1k → MPDx ESP32 ADC.  PLT5 520B typ monitor current ≈150uA → about 1.5V at 10k." (at 36 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001229))
  (text "ISENSE headroom: keep I_laser ≲ 250 mA so V_sense (=I·10Ω) stays inside the ESP32 ADC range with margin." (at 36 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001230))
